cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MPA-OpenCL: A Differentially Verified Multiple-Precision Arithmetic Library for Heterogeneous Devices"
abstract: >-
  A portable multiple-precision arithmetic library written in standard OpenCL C,
  providing fifteen fixed-width big-integer operations at operand widths from 256
  to 2048 bits and machine word sizes of 8, 16 and 32 bits, on any OpenCL 1.2
  device. Every output word is checked against GMP across the full cross-product
  of operations, moduli and kernel variants before any configuration is timed.
type: software
